# The version map: for every IYAKKI version, what the add-on is built from.
# One line per entry, whitespace-separated, fields in this order:
#   IYAKKI_VERSION  FFMPEG_VERSION  FFMPEG_SOURCE_SHA256  BUILDER_IMAGE_WITH_DIGEST  SONAMES(comma separated)
# IYAKKI_VERSION may end in .* (any version with that prefix). The first matching line wins.
# An entry is removed when its source or builder image is no longer available; CHANGELOG.md announces that first.
# The FFmpeg source is downloaded from https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-<FFMPEG_VERSION>.tar.xz at the person's request, and checked against the hash.
